// Title: Set Files as System Files Using Attrib.EXE
// Rule ID: bb19e94c-59ae-4c15-8c12-c563d23fe52b
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1564.001, detection.threat-hunting
// Category: process_creation
